sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as main()
    participant Data as contacts.txt
    participant Table as HashTable
    participant Export as VCF output

    CLI->>Table: Allocate initial buckets
    CLI->>Data: Read rows at startup
    Data-->>CLI: Comma-delimited records
    CLI->>Table: Insert parsed contacts
    loop Menu iteration
        CLI->>User: Display choices and prompt
        User-->>CLI: Menu choice and values
        CLI->>Table: Execute operation
        opt Export choice
            CLI->>Export: Write vCard fields
        end
        CLI->>Data: Rewrite current contacts
    end
